<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/eng@/~cl_20__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2a) For the purpose of paragraph (2)(d), “negotiator” means a person who is employed by a registered estate agent to assist him in the estate agency practice.”. Amendment of section 22d"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/eng@> .
