<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 1 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “Valuers, Appraisers and Estate Agents Act 1981” the words “Valuers, Appraisers, Estate Agents and Property Managers Act 1981”. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/26/eng@> .
